{
  "name": "Automated US Healthcare NPI Doctor & Clinic Lead Enricher (CMS API) — Daily B2B Data & Compliance Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated US Healthcare NPI Doctor & Clinic Lead Enricher (CMS API) Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nB2B healthcare lead extractor and enricher for US doctors, dentists, clinics, and hospitals using the official CMS NPPES NPI Registry API v2.1. Extracts NPI-1 and NPI-2 records, practice addresses, phone numbers, primary taxonomy, state licenses, and AI-ready lead dossiers.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/us-healthcare-npi-provider-lead-enricher](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-healthcare-npi-provider-lead-enricher)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: us-healthcare-npi-provider-lead-enricher** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7730a56f-e0ef-5661-9880-95ca7803ba05",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8061ed86-6c34-55d9-a313-133d4e3fdc43",
      "name": "Daily 07:00 AM Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~us-healthcare-npi-provider-lead-enricher/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"taxonomies\": [\n    \"Cardiology\",\n    \"Dermatology\"\n  ],\n  \"state\": \"NY\",\n  \"max_results\": 10\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "59e10221-b201-52ab-96ff-f921c4e43ce1",
      "name": "Apify Engine: us-healthcare-npi-provider-lead-enricher",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a0656592-a576-5100-b378-60265c93ba40",
              "leftValue": "={{ Object.keys($json).length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "ef502382-a9d2-55ba-9338-aa5fa117e790",
      "name": "Validate Structured Dataset Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
